From 3c8696b8eec154d05b0b1cd31ae00a411eee90cd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: x <x@x>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 15:25:27 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] cheeseburger: WMI INIT/READY, HTT rx ring, passive scan (W5
 part 2)

0153 test 2: with WLAN_MODE OFF 2 s after mission the SoC stayed up; left in mission without WMI INIT it froze ~10 s later. sweet_wmi.c ports topaz 0123/0125 (APSL 2.0): SERVICE_READY parse, host memory chunks, INIT with the wcn3990 resource config, READY, HTT frag bank + 64-bit rx ring, then a passive scan of 2.4/5 GHz (nothing transmitted), networks logged with masked BSSID. sweet_wce.c gets the topaz WMI credit queue and dispatches WMI/HTT. Modem pool 16 MiB at 0xb0800000, MSA moved to 0xb0400000.
---
